From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ken Russell <kbr@chromium.org>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 19:16:32 -0700
Subject: GL: add defer_gl_delete_buffers workaround.

Add a workaround which defers calls to glDeleteBuffers while the
buffer might be in use by in-flight GPU work. Apply this workaround to
Mali GPUs.

Distilled and integrated test cases from the bug report. Confirmed on
device that the test cases reliably catch the crash, and that the
workaround eliminates it.

Co-authored with Gemini.

Bug: chromium:558870371
Change-Id: I4b9246a42e863fe2dd45b20a8eeea7357475fc99
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/angle/angle/+/8448362
Commit-Queue: Shahbaz Youssefi <syoussefi@chromium.org>
Reviewed-by: Shahbaz Youssefi <syoussefi@chromium.org>

